--कृतम्, Treta, द्वापरम् and Kali. The section deals with the differences between them under the heads युगधर्म, युगसन्धि, अम्शक and युगसन्- धान। These are in भारतवर्ष;
1: Br. II. २९. 1 ff. M. १४२. 2 and १७, २३.
According to the युगम्स् the height of men, birds, beasts and plants decreases [page१-580+ २६] or increases;
2: Br. ३२. 8 ff.
Manu's height is अष्टताल and one whose height is नवताल is praised even by Gods.
3: Ib. ३५. १७२.
