described.
5: Vi. VI. 1. 5-7; 3. ११-40.

--the four castes; विष्णु, their creator and protector;
1: Br. II. ३७. 5; III. ७२. ३५; Vi. I. 6. 5-6, 8.
originated by the four sons of सुव्रता, daughter of दक्ष;
2: वा. ३०. ६७; ९७. ३६; १००. ४४; Br. II. १३. ६५.
people observe स्वधर्म in कृत, attain change in Treta, become weak in द्वापर and lose all character in the Kali age;
3: M. १६८. 8-१२.
fresh impetus by शौनक and by भार्ग- भूमि.
4: Vi. IV. 8. 6, २०.
